1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,040
LocalStock Unified is a fully local A-share market data, quantitative backtesting and AI analysis desktop tool.

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:12,200
Three components: the Electron desktop app, the JoinQuant-compatible backtesting service, and Price Action AI, all sharing one local SQLite database.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:17,430
It covers all 5973 A-share stocks, with daily data from June 1991 to today, about 18.84 million rows.

4
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:28,180
K-lines span from 1-minute to quarterly, with MA, MACD, KDJ, Bollinger Bands, and fully customizable indicator parameters.

5
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:34,450
Drawing tools include six types: trend lines, rays, horizontal, rectangle, Fibonacci and channels. Draw by hand, or let AI draw for you.

6
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:39,670
Intraday charts refresh in real time, with aggregated news and announcements on the right, AI builds the timeline automatically.

7
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,870
Built-in strategy templates, CodeMirror Python editor, one-click backtesting.

8
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:46,090
The JoinQuant-compatible service is based on the open-source JoinQuant package under the MIT license. Turtle multi-factor backtest: 23% annualized, 0.65 Sharpe.

9
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,090
MA golden cross and death cross alerts scan the whole market instantly, deduplicated across restarts.

10
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:54,170
The Price Action AI follows the Al Brooks two-stage reasoning framework, outputting market diagnosis and trading decisions.

11
00:00:54,170 --> 00:01:07,120
AI-first design: reads all market data, can analyze, draw, run backtests and screen stocks. Write operations are audited and one-click rollbackable.

12
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:21,690
Built-in strategy knowledge base. Future: knowledge graph for self-evolving algorithms, networked platform, and automated factor mining.

13
00:01:21,690 --> 00:01:28,190
Model backend supports DeepSeek, OpenCode, Anthropic, and local Ollama. API keys stay in memory only, never written to disk.

14
00:01:28,190 --> 00:01:39,990
Market data is sourced redundantly from Eastmoney, Tencent and Sina, with independent monitoring windows and floating views.

15
00:01:39,990 --> 00:02:00,000
All data stays local. No login, no internet required. Your data never leaves this machine.
